repository-code: 'https://github.com/acljaya/constrained-ai-agent-5g-core'
abstract: >-
  A constrained AI agent framework for autonomous
  fault management in cloud-native 5G core networks.
  The framework uses a bounded action space of three
  operations (WAIT, RESTART_POD, SCALE_UP) combined
  with fast-path routing to reconcile adaptive
  reasoning with operational stability. Experimentally
  validated across 240 controlled trials on an
  Open5GS 5G core running on Kubernetes with
  Chaos Mesh fault injection, benchmarked against
  a rule-based baseline.
keywords:
  - 5G core network
  - fault management
  - large language models
  - constrained AI agents
